 "text": "9/29/26, 9:41 AM\n\ney\n\nWODIO\u201cN\n~\\. Device Category\n\n(Material)\n\nSS\n\nDevi\neon                               Purchase Order\n\n\\\\\n\n\u2019\nInstallation                   Serial Number =\nStructure                           Device Number\n\nGoods Receipt\n\nInstallation                               Device Stock (MM\nRemoval                                            Warehouse)\n\nMM is also used for the following functions in device flow:\n\nFunction                                                                                      Component\n\nProcurement                                                                                Purchase Requisition and Purchase Order from Purchasing (MM-\nPUR)\n\nDelivery                                                                                       Goods Receipt from Inventory Management (MM-IM)\n\nOutward Movement (such as scrapping or sales)                              Goods Issue and Return Deliveryfrom MM-IM\n\nStock Transfer                                                                  Goods Issue and Return Deliveryfrom MM-IM\n\nEquipment records are created automatically during goods receipt. Therefore, functions from the PM application component are\nused, including standard ordering functions and creation of maintenance plans or task lists. Billing is then carried out with the\nSales and Distribution (SD) component.\n\nSee Also\n\ne PM: Equipment\n\ne LO-MD: Material Master\n\ne MM-PUR: Purchase Requisitions, Purchase Orders\n",
